[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2406.47, "timestamp": "00:40:06", "text": "，問題在於我沒有切換我的類別。我總是在Kick的VTuber分類下瀏覽，對吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2409.75, "timestamp": "00:40:09", "text": "？  是的，我總是在Kick的VTuber分類下瀏覽。所以踢球並不重要，對吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2415.67, "timestamp": "00:40:15", "text": "所以這就是我優先考慮 Twitch 的原因。所以從某種意義上來說，我們可以讓它奏效。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2417.91, "timestamp": "00:40:17", "text": "如果我們檢查的是 Twitch，那應該沒問題吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2421.829, "timestamp": "00:40:21", "text": "？所以，下一個版本，例如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2424.55, "timestamp": "00:40:24", "text": "我想讓它具備以下功能：假設"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2427.27, "timestamp": "00:40:27", "text": "我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2432.47, "timestamp": "00:40:32", "text": "在我的電腦上開啟一個遊戲，它會"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2435.75, "timestamp": "00:40:35", "text": "檢查正在開啟的是什麼遊戲。如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2440.87, "timestamp": "00:40:40", "text": "是我想要的特定遊戲，我想讓它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2446.87, "timestamp": "00:40:46", "text": "在 Twitch 上自動更改類別，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2450.39, "timestamp": "00:40:50", "text": "例如，我打開 Genshin Impact.exe。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2452.63, "timestamp": "00:40:52", "text": "它會把我的遊戲分類改成原神"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2455.349, "timestamp": "00:40:55", "text": "。"}]